#: scenario4:scenario4_EF1A17E8_E766_4047_942C_3956E1C7BE73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 948d5a3a9c401ad57db9da4fbab7b67cfdda22c53c8f1a2a6c0588392d550e1d
#. default-sha256: 84ca5ccfa99f8497fb8c7766d742adac49ec10c1178b46e2dc733644832d7c1d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EF1A17E8_E766_4047_942C_3956E1C7BE73"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Master, ⟪k:31⟫"
"Master... ⟪k:32⟫Please, wake up... ⟪k:33⟫Return to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫"
"Padrone, ⟪k:33⟫Padrone... ⟪k:34⟫La prego, si svegli... ⟪k:35⟫Torni da me."

#: scenario4:scenario4_503D27F7_8B5F_43A6_939E_1AA8BB215BAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8b1197884df632a78a9cad8b9758037fcc9b9a70d49324666735a1ee9d37211
#. default-sha256: bdca512ce796c33ce697c6c72b5a9d9f6f36f1ab032d6a6612af4d3d5e526b4b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_503D27F7_8B5F_43A6_939E_1AA8BB215BAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Ahh, have you come to, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Ahh, finalmente."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B6BED36E_D636_466F_9CB0_E46702883FBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9860a49eed92a28ee601cb51a4cb9575620dca1dbd0caa020d3c4ac43be9a44b
#. default-sha256: d0ea08e7e516de7e20660731a0c3a5f710ecec6e15c3a14f6e0362bbcfae995e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B6BED36E_D636_466F_9CB0_E46702883FBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫I apologize for sending you through the door without warning. ⟪k:2⟫It must have "
"given you quite the scare."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Mi dispiace averla fatta entrare senza avvertirla.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dev’essere stato un "
"bello spavento per lei."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F4926009_F4AB_479C_B9E1_F997361B0A47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 900cf873fa4af058d3284bab3b51f8b5be4521a3854227141fcdc1fd3f320407
#. default-sha256: ad1f60e97175c5f274de0a545b6aaaf878fa8a80f119be1c2a3c5304842b0434
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F4926009_F4AB_479C_B9E1_F997361B0A47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I beg your forgiveness. ⟪k:1⟫I heard a terrible screaming from down the stairs, and I "
"panicked."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La prego di perdonarmi, ⟪k:1⟫ma avevo sentito delle urla terrificanti provenienti dal piano "
"terra, e mi sono impaurita."

#: scenario4:scenario4_4829A852_0DB6_42A3_A350_3736771CD151
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a07675addcf12ba0b85f91e5fe49a22f8616856ebe5537a6927121762db6c5d
#. default-sha256: 2368f50dda3b172a08ca39ce94ebc60b87668f111802bbeae808199828f1a20b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4829A852_0DB6_42A3_A350_3736771CD151"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You say you saw the White-Haired Girl? ⟪k:1⟫I see, so you made it into the world beyond the "
"door before me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dice di aver visto la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi? Capisco...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dunque ha raggiunto "
"il mondo oltre la porta prima di me."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CE8E1503_DC64_4929_80B3_3ECAA6DED4C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2d28c4094d5b40f890a12736c1cac3ff0c016e702bbe8f65aa9aa2f86a24a93
#. default-sha256: 640ab0d8b7df61aeb11457eb8150d195cb7d6bb6cb81ee1d904c8f9b83baad1f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CE8E1503_DC64_4929_80B3_3ECAA6DED4C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I am deeply relieved that I was able to take your hand before losing sight of you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sono profondamente sollevata per essere riuscita a prenderle la mano prima che potessi "
"perderla di vista."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A89676AB_8E73_4969_BFD6_ECF5DFBA303F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71beea5225b3384231922900db43c71123d5dcbc116441d0a3328d28a81c108a
#. default-sha256: 50cf4412517638b6fb3a6da70127701356ac43091ac02ffa91b57b2e2b863adf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A89676AB_8E73_4969_BFD6_ECF5DFBA303F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I presume you have already grown familiar with the atmosphere of this time period, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Presumo che lei abbia una certa familiarità con l’atmosfera di questa epoca, Padrone."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DC3DF9C7_9FBF_40AE_988A_CE94D3BAA312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 479a7c35baaea5a1ceb2956c8bb264f1cb07f4bcaddd791370d9815f339cba15
#. default-sha256: d656aae2cccd65774afa695911472731fee5b5aaef6c8b3141ffb9932c2110d3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DC3DF9C7_9FBF_40AE_988A_CE94D3BAA312"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you have seen her, as you said, then you should have a basic grasp of the situation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se dice di averla vista, allora dovrebbe già avere una conoscenza di base della situazione."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B0DE5C00_C06F_41F7_84D9_244D3E94237F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4406a39c4c5493a93b4df1db678b9e4cafdce8b8123c5e148ad95815c6055c4
#. default-sha256: 5831d59dbec6969c06d52dfe9ed569487baceb01d94813eb10adc827eecd4213
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B0DE5C00_C06F_41F7_84D9_244D3E94237F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was a very misfortunate girl in this era, accused of being a witch, abused and "
"persecuted. ⟪k:1⟫Her life was in constant danger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era una ragazza molto sfortunata, a quel tempo, accusata di essere una strega, maltrattata e "
"perseguitata. ⟪k:1⟫La sua vita era in costante pericolo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5B14F580_3322_4667_81E2_C62F6B032F8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c88360694755b92c0f3b0e5f90116ef2d2bedc8ffcd1fe26735ffb676255a2b6
#. default-sha256: 5f8db05ee36b6e94f512e796ac815a7da34568f9e85d919c9065f2c89a837ff1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5B14F580_3322_4667_81E2_C62F6B032F8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was, again, her appearance that brought this upon her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That snow-white hair and "
"those ruby-red eyes⟪k:3⟫clearly differentiated her from everyone else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ancora una volta, era il suo aspetto la causa dei suoi mali.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quei capelli color "
"neve e i suoi occhi color rosso rubino la rendevano chiaramente diversa da chiunque altro."

#: scenario4:scenario4_216105B8_88CE_4A72_8B7B_472E05F650C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5343ca56ed226d676cc96f94648a194b78574436bb193878fd891f6fa81479c5
#. default-sha256: fe920138e35fdcbe31f99a6b60e0e97d0522f657b35537fb6a2eb74f97238ff9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_216105B8_88CE_4A72_8B7B_472E05F650C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, and I apologize.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I neglected to mention that this door is... ⟪k:3⟫unique."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, e mi perdoni.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Avevo dimenticato di menzionare che questa porta è... ⟪k:3⟫unica."

#: scenario4:scenario4_65367644_11A3_4D7F_86E4_F52198CE1EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 256466fc825de4f6ada0c005f7d0e19b6f1d186170f475de5a01440a59b10ff6
#. default-sha256: 16ddf2195dbd01754b8e1adc25498dcd7ff2985f68f7f00cf2dba9a82d787bf4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_65367644_11A3_4D7F_86E4_F52198CE1EB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As for ⟪k:1⟫what⟪k:2⟫ sets it apart... ⟪k:3⟫that will be made clear as we proceed, though "
"one difference is in the time period."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Riguardo a ⟪k:1⟫cosa⟪k:2⟫ la renda tale... ⟪k:3⟫beh, quello sarà chiaro strada facendo, ma "
"c’è una differenza in questo caso:"

#: scenario4:scenario4_39697E4D_326A_4396_A090_794433BA31D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 196e368337163b2d4ee5cd4dc9349a75e90499e9feb2591e05736ffe007b53c9
#. default-sha256: 7a0980d689b6f4dda64d513988d084b4f68f5286a589811ec4d68c99a0f82486
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_39697E4D_326A_4396_A090_794433BA31D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tales I have shown you began with that of the beautiful flaxen-haired family, followed "
"by the tale of the bloodthirsty beast, and then the tale of steel and ambition—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫le storie che le ho narrato finora—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫prima quella della bellissima famiglia dai "
"capelli dorati,⟪k:4⟫seguita da quella della bestia assetata di sangue,⟪k:5⟫e poi da quella "
"dell’acciaio e dell’ambizione—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8B7DF58_C837_4E48_9E3D_AF6E8C6DF8CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecbe18522fac002f69a291e772b9f59b7f9d05b77a2cae98192fdb4bd2be3093
#. default-sha256: 33e0b2483527aa93fa15364189b8428bf9522ea723906d09a7dc574eabacb397
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8B7DF58_C837_4E48_9E3D_AF6E8C6DF8CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫proceeding in chronological order."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫si sono susseguite in ordine cronologico."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7067907_DA0C_4EB9_8D7D_6640B2D55A9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 689a87cc41d1ff6d3b9bbadd541214b10c9caa0302dc15755183333eb4d04de1
#. default-sha256: 9ee8fa99663a851176dd890bed7ceaea8a3045bd37fce3730b9ef7214ae014ab
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7067907_DA0C_4EB9_8D7D_6640B2D55A9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the door we have just entered takes us to the period now known as the Middle Ages—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫long, long before the other three tales."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, la porta che abbiamo appena varcato ci conduce in un’era conosciuta come "
"“Medioevo”—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫venuta molto, molto tempo prima delle altre tre storie."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F51BB548_F386_48E9_8932_FEEBFC358CEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a85aba1bad32f7d7930e0bb228a1c3aa48b3f40bfb86a11f4a85c99a839ddab5
#. default-sha256: a5cb7a61c9001b96351cb0573275bd01c04077eb65e2c36c9acd34ff8de6fc0f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F51BB548_F386_48E9_8932_FEEBFC358CEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Yes, that is correct—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫this is where it all began."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sì, esatto—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫è qui che tutto è cominciato."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B080792D_0CD8_44B3_8B25_6D9B097B6DDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08d9976cdfb0e20d1c0c778f5c8e92a60c13d8dc3a965afb748dac139c6ff014
#. default-sha256: 4585d436a629ce4a1129e947a31b2376f411f3043c18a26396df0b326caa6c86
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B080792D_0CD8_44B3_8B25_6D9B097B6DDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion’s curse, the truth of the witch, and Your identity—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫all of this should "
"be made known."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La maledizione della villa, la verità sulla strega,⟪k:1⟫e la Sua identità, Padrone—⟪k:2⟫"
"tutto questo verrà a galla."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FD5932F4_9DF0_4A24_A415_6821C45C5F28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfb59e9c3c164c0d6fa2727cfe68d637074bc4d7df6e8e31b2ef64265ae06921
#. default-sha256: 0baf5c02b0144c21fd680a479495e0a41b565790a9fed80f673567893a5fc271
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FD5932F4_9DF0_4A24_A415_6821C45C5F28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If, after this tale, you are still unable to reclaim your old self..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se anche dopo questo racconto lei non avrà ritrovato la sua identità..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7014308B_F4B1_447F_9CB7_5CA77E0FF0E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5476dd332357f4dc26d803c0ccf6743ab286bb308aa8580cd363036e9f370a41
#. default-sha256: d9ff241de28988a569b948c3fdcba2279bf1fe2f20da105dd85ee0ef81aac14d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7014308B_F4B1_447F_9CB7_5CA77E0FF0E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then there is nothing more I can do."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫allora non ci sarà più nulla che io possa fare."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9E0F62D7_DFFD_4981_8761_35EF94496288
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b2678440342dcb5e6aac19ed1a303be01417ea9e7d5ad23badbad8b861881b3
#. default-sha256: 81742e88bdf04d85c1ca6f95bdc47983755aa8ccfed7fd3e5a8fe4cc7668d176
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9E0F62D7_DFFD_4981_8761_35EF94496288"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This door contains the last tale I am able to tell you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Questa porta contiene l’ultimo scenario che sono in grado di mostrarle."

#: scenario4:scenario4_88E14716_86DD_462E_B6F6_C4834BBED190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e41b28e3f471529289e6dded95461e68fcc0d0bffe063e28b0f60cba7286d1fc
#. default-sha256: 3d4c1ec3b6983def666292ac4d758149acb4d8ae237c1aaf6a68c35129bd5958
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_88E14716_86DD_462E_B6F6_C4834BBED190"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I ask of you, please do not let go of my hand until it is all over."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Per questo le chiedo di non lasciare la mia mano finché non sarà tutto finito."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AC56C405_318B_451F_8F8C_D053D0AA1B11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f22a3847b4b360c7768a8ccc530cf85d18244b8979a5a6c887ca70523a3f1410
#. default-sha256: 94b2f2febf761a1a4fc5d0b68c24eb91885f2a2da79b4e946e52f3ed92a79453
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AC56C405_318B_451F_8F8C_D053D0AA1B11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now then... ⟪k:1⟫let us begin a beautiful, tragic love story of two solitary souls trapped "
"in a mansion of darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dunque... ⟪k:1⟫iniziamo questa splendida, tragica storia d’amore tra due anime solitarie, "
"intrappolate in una villa oscura."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CE1D801E_A386_4F81_80B7_82F1195D43E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd3e2a780618f6ba40c8d6be981daa5807daeade24817d77f991fdb3aa3d4181
#. default-sha256: 05935ff34fa07d6a5510896b62eb8410e8bfd23ca9a63d756291c0ffa3a75850
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CE1D801E_A386_4F81_80B7_82F1195D43E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“In that era, the mansion was a dungeon draped in darkness.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“In quell’epoca, la villa era una segreta avvolta nelle tenebre.”"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E35BAA66_2050_4774_B272_0FCB6FDE5585
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86cccab6db4948999c278928dabe351ca0778a23c42e7233e5d736d3839adff1
#. default-sha256: 418a99757fa84988b679fa2e35850152175b73af8b4d7c8581dce805d0fbab6c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E35BAA66_2050_4774_B272_0FCB6FDE5585"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"After a great deal of time on the run, the White-Haired Girl found herself at a remote mansion "
"that stood in a dark, overgrown forest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"Dopo molto tempo passato a fuggire, la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi⟪k:34⟫si ritrovò in una villa "
"remota, situata in una foresta fitta e oscura."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AFEBC3C4_5AF7_4030_B83A_9E34957C8E95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11c167de6a62e61a1e13c80a4f5c6f4adf3786a4089ee7a84e61e9ad712197e5
#. default-sha256: ac7d8dbb936cc80a504896ce37250afa0e6e483c171e033eb94892d699f1dcaf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AFEBC3C4_5AF7_4030_B83A_9E34957C8E95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All the windows were either boarded or shuttered, and it was even darker inside the house "
"than out. ⟪k:1⟫Not even a ray of moonlight could enter those walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tutte le finestre erano o chiuse o sbarrate, e dentro casa era più buio che all’esterno. "
"⟪k:1⟫Nemmeno il chiaro di luna vi poteva entrare."

#: scenario4:scenario4_ADB062E9_E426_4361_A74B_446D17D80C5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0ed6f076798953209617890a184ac41e79f4db5edeeee2abc0ca7cac24f1b28
#. default-sha256: c801b513106221f13d25f09b3d85e98e56503779388bf4fdf8567ea34c49c759
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_ADB062E9_E426_4361_A74B_446D17D80C5C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Only naturally, the White-Haired Girl⟪k:1⟫had assumed that nobody lived there,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era naturale che la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi avesse pensato che nessuno vi abitasse,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BB7025AD_075F_449F_AF2C_A1E7C0EAB154
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 842e9e52988c1443a0b54375c337102603e5e2dbecca6ca9d5f9de89e72452ef
#. default-sha256: 536d462217f50b7bb64c6607dd5764624e5b0c4e34e384303769956396f136b9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BB7025AD_075F_449F_AF2C_A1E7C0EAB154"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but her guess was incorrect.⟪k:1⟫Someone did, indeed, dwell in the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ma la sua deduzione era sbagliata.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Difatti, qualcuno dimorava in quella casa."

#: scenario4:scenario4_063519C7_29A5_48FC_982F_67086C2728C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c17a1f2f9d4200fa8dd7f4cb8ccc09aca1503da93ff668a5496250584a1d701
#. default-sha256: 1f4e2c4630c5d547267565d11bbac03526e43c0acc954e5a57d8083ff7edaac6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_063519C7_29A5_48FC_982F_67086C2728C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a young man named Michel. ⟪k:1⟫Though she could not make out the details of his face "
"in the candlelight, she thought him a very handsome man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era un giovane chiamato Michel. ⟪k:1⟫Sebbene lei non riuscisse a scorgere⟪k:2⟫i dettagli del "
"suo viso alla luce della candela, lo immaginava come un uomo molto affascinante."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D06033B_76FB_4AD6_B6E2_689D1E6CB834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47a73724a68d2629cfc0389c5a610c5e1cc04e2a03de1bfdfdcb830f2fc7ec5a
#. default-sha256: f0ccd72263575ef35a9f84bbffdd7de9b64025ecee2649397ba721b922b23b01
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D06033B_76FB_4AD6_B6E2_689D1E6CB834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, he proclaimed to her that a witch resided within the mansion, and that he too was "
"cursed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, egli aveva affermato che una strega dimorava nella villa,⟪k:1⟫e che anche lui era "
"maledetto."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F97B061F_C94C_4E47_9083_4DF3A43CF7F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10288c74b379479c7f0e1eceaa1065f5e8a1c37baac9802bea8e8005a25e1843
#. default-sha256: a9483f24f40a994cd48fc7b7670cda86874ed7dd98e9b20238c4655564e38f5c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F97B061F_C94C_4E47_9083_4DF3A43CF7F4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everyone who got close to him lost their lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tutti coloro che si erano avvicinati a lui, avevano perso la vita."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D46E1850_A638_4423_8478_E8299693BAC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19c46a2177da391c57499b13bba8b2a122e1cf5eabc1a3969351118b94d3abc1
#. default-sha256: 1769d941366102575a59d34384c011f4272276eecd52dd2c8aab1ecbfcc153d1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D46E1850_A638_4423_8478_E8299693BAC6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do you think that what he told her was all nonsense?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A lie devised to chase her out "
"of the house?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pensa che lui le avesse detto una marea di sciocchezze?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Una bugia ideata per "
"cacciarla di casa?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_887E6F9E_D819_4002_A13F_1F6FE4BFC4CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ced8c72377eac73390cbc1a5036e94f2de9c86c548a7ffb2afbd92c2b1cd073d
#. default-sha256: feb503e9748c18aa0cd19e41523601a774ea2670cc644bb6fee7263dd8d2b277
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_887E6F9E_D819_4002_A13F_1F6FE4BFC4CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The truth of the matter shall come to light in time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La verità verrà presto svelata."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DAE10AA8_CF55_4E6B_8531_40A384D97174
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bd301e9bcf009db41507d607a899c1aca560ab189e1744682ded0eb2d93c390
#. default-sha256: 1cb9d224b23491e2180645f456af3d1bb2198dae4d3757d7781a18e1a1a2632f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DAE10AA8_CF55_4E6B_8531_40A384D97174"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Despite Michel’s assertions, the White-Haired Girl decided she would take up "
"residence within the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Malgrado l’avvertimento di Michel, la ragazza decise di stabilirsi all’interno "
"della villa."

#: scenario4:scenario4_667912EF_7C4A_4A04_A635_6ED2F38EABC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6aa353fdac35c0ed7f3d5569f739394c513cf377236135cdd36b5db8bc010b41
#. default-sha256: e86b8c67753f4b1ef25f3797166e5b028acd32de70489c3a18a756e1174bbaee
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_667912EF_7C4A_4A04_A635_6ED2F38EABC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This era’s White-Haired Girl was younger than the others; ⟪k:1⟫she was still in her early "
"teens, young enough to be seen as still a child."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi di quest’epoca era più giovane rispetto alle altre; ⟪k:1⟫era "
"ancora un’adolescente, abbastanza giovane da essere vista come una bambina."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D2425DFE_6D2B_4CFA_945A_6627E9588E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9855785d889504e2ae52d3eb441e54340c6f3556a1827353753cbf1d73e9adeb
#. default-sha256: d2dd6e5a0fe5d06255c29f6b1f05d6794d0c0ba9b814369da7ffc63eb5e3c04e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D2425DFE_6D2B_4CFA_945A_6627E9588E3D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But she was neither as self-centered nor irresponsible as you might expect of someone her "
"age. ⟪k:1⟫She was very delicate and reserved, and acted with a great deal of modesty and "
"restraint."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non era né egocentrica né irresponsabile come ci si aspetterebbe da qualcuno della sua "
"età. ⟪k:1⟫Era molto delicata e riservata, e mostrava una certa modestia e compostezza."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5F668DAB_F665_40A3_8C34_2A2FB0ACC034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0c00c5436f8907a9e685c2504022a31400553e6b56b0f5a2df9323ee638eab6
#. default-sha256: a2f30208f71efa1701b8330b3645c98a30d9e6ed0a75b419fdfe948032a7a55e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5F668DAB_F665_40A3_8C34_2A2FB0ACC034"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The accusations of her being a criminal and a sinner were grossly inappropriate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le voci che l’accusavano di essere una criminale e una peccatrice erano esageratamente "
"inappropriate."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3E99F111_B2C5_4066_BB9C_80997DD2F721
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad9b00edf4732aa7f6277599344f84d64ac25fcb220b79096b03cb6818c7751b
#. default-sha256: 77ec9cc899ce49a98e5c7177035dfd9cb17689a7a5f18f38a5461cc01eb82d68
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3E99F111_B2C5_4066_BB9C_80997DD2F721"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, she was still chased from her home, barely managing to flee to this mansion "
"with her life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ciò nonostante, era stata comunque cacciata di casa, riuscendo a malapena ad avere salva la "
"vita."

#: scenario4:scenario4_850175EC_D1E2_45B3_9009_E5E6C4FD45CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a43e0d5b571b770265bf4e0c5eaaa151ff8864cc8d04e757a6d02f7ceb5c0147
#. default-sha256: 25f34f4c382768f94fd319ba5eaf1dd7640c9140b657e19f66c9fcef7e605fde
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_850175EC_D1E2_45B3_9009_E5E6C4FD45CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, the White-Haired Girl thought it would be rude to simply take up space in the mansion, "
"so she chased down the master, Michel,⟪k:1⟫and asked,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dunque. La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi pensava fosse scortese occupare spazio nella villa, "
"così rintracciò il padrone, Michel,⟪k:1⟫e gli chiese:"

#: scenario4:scenario4_564B2023_C5DB_4394_B3B1_ABF82315653B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d54ad58764078ad7fda1de4b64ec9f1e0aeece9ea23af187e52f389c5d5116cf
#. default-sha256: 81d542913ea5892a5b1b2e9da0ab6cff4d0a5437ff1e0a679752f5001b877168
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_564B2023_C5DB_4394_B3B1_ABF82315653B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Um... ⟪k:1⟫is there anything I can do to help?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I will clean or cook or do anything—"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫just let me know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ehm... ⟪k:1⟫c’è qualcosa che posso fare per aiutare?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Pulire, o cucinare, qualunque "
"cosa—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫basta che me lo dica."

#: scenario4:scenario4_80723D57_F9F3_4459_871F_E1D44427A5FD
