msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BE10CFE3_211A_4E34_88DD_5AB38D5D4A1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a3a84a2fafc32a638bf7b1711990fb1791ecfe35e064c519b3e88e1737dc695
#. default-sha256: b9a60c47e137b838c272b2c305720d955e0081ef646b5ba79d5fef01da06e9f3
