msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Fintanto...?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1788B948_3811_48FC_969B_EFF9781C218B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6ceb86dbd9403d8d41c410602b24c68e7e64ab18136cf86d757b54e9e53a576
