msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He said emotionlessly, turning away and walking off."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Disse con indifferenza prima di voltarsi, allontanandosi."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97fc93eaa45ca1a59ebe8e4c7f98426531d7f6911591efb971cfca856979f126
#. default-sha256: 5a68844d7bd6f8a1bae41715d71af147b6381f1245f1d6908bf52a8e45a1d0a2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel was not, I believe, spurning her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was merely disinterested. ⟪k:3⟫He did "
"not treat her disrespectfully, nor did he seem averse to her presence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non credo che Michel la stesse respingendo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫era soltanto disinteressato.⟪k:3⟫ Non "
"la trattava irrispettosamente, né era avverso⟪k:4⟫alla sua presenza."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef73d6dc38e5624c19a4166411c08f4a4d9a4f1444b67798a65a8038ba575876
#. default-sha256: a4b3872452870fba9619dcb98e84125eeb5202e655b04b7c233938bb838e806c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Words simply did not seem to affect him at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Semplicemente le parole sembravano non avere alcun effetto su di lui."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c43e2d83c6ac088d095d6a20fdb510c350305c650132a3943b0b107164daa38c
#. default-sha256: a3292c7cf07998b7aa6d8f4c4c3a65b6d35b634f8c8a8dc374c500425f4e0c24
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not only was the mansion a prison for his body, his body was also a prison ensnaring his "
"heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non solo la villa era una prigione per il suo corpo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫anche il suo corpo era una "
"prigione che intrappolava il suo cuore."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df96370df159fd5f8b2d526581f42630323ca1ef678cdd978e1ce2d51ffa568b
#. default-sha256: 3ca791f0023522a6e8030c176b10ad9ff490242860c49a9dc88510eb7e579dfa
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I should still do whatever I can.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Devo comunque fare il possibile.)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dab0be465755d0188979895ae768842dfe1f95cb73d3103f99a5d22544df7b8b
#. default-sha256: 5c0677858bb569c227fce1dc6e0c864338dd8fcd3c9c368f5893207e0fd7ab26
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But she did not let that get her down. ⟪k:1⟫In fact, she might have even interpreted his "
"disinterest as kindness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma lei non si fece abbattere. ⟪k:1⟫Anzi, potrebbe aver persino interpretato⟪k:2⟫il suo "
"disinteresse come una forma di gentilezza."

#: scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 200eb25cad00130e3a8da4bdc709be02ba5d25426e76ecd362af6b59834de37f
#. default-sha256: d2b9e16b630532880ba0e71dc20cc082d684d13f4ed8be044d88d59cd10e3055
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he was a bit standoffish, he did not attempt to cause her harm. ⟪k:1⟫He was nothing "
"like the people who had accused her of being a witch and forced her to flee for her life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene fosse un po’ freddo, lui non tentò di farle del male.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non aveva niente a "
"che vedere con la gente che l’aveva accusata di essere una strega, e che l’aveva costretta a "
"fuggire pur di salvarsi la vita."

#: scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e9bb9816819f4ba2ed6851578ef0498ed2f6496057fe7ac8f0d68217cf8b055
#. default-sha256: e95a17d0b9f77d651a08d67b2e95aca6d8cd2ec58e7801b64bba8a0f30fe4444
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And she was deeply grateful for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E per questo lei gli era profondamente grata."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 116532293b835c68e1b00cda324da024d725dc1da8b4e27967171db111c6a57b
#. default-sha256: e4771827b53b6d8f08cbff3bca9301dda65c4be978b675d60700b22256c4eba6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Thus began their quiet life together—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Michel, who avoided contact with others, "
"and the White-Haired Girl, who had taken a great deal of abuse from others."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E fu così che iniziò la loro vita tranquilla insieme—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Michel, che evitava ogni "
"contatto con le persone, e la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi, a cui veniva data la caccia."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02f9976175de09054a1eedabcd43286c9495c14d878b08d35e7402dc5a6bab14
#. default-sha256: 8ec65de1ad9cec9e51e5acae9c6869d7f9b1dd8f9dba8fc57f482167785df875
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Two people who knew hardly anything about one another—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫who were too distant to "
"really be said to be living “together.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Due persone che non sapevano pressoché niente l’uno dell’altra—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫che erano fin "
"troppo distanti per dire che vivessero “insieme”."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c47fb788b38df5e5b3f366293e59da879ccf3e4242c5481a27eb58f3ff5626d1
#. default-sha256: d85dda6a80158cf313e487cec55b3287f3f4c70d3a6576a04cee4a914a49ba56
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his day in his chambers, so they only ever saw each other occasionally, "
"and they hardly ever spoke."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel trascorreva gran parte della giornata nella sua stanza, perciò si vedevano solo "
"occasionalmente, e a malapena si parlavano."

#: scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a5b3bff70696527755d96a7683690fe6eda21c403a040896752838d312b3131
#. default-sha256: 68cd6b82d82a15d4b0151a27d48f31969d74603892b8aec4ca87a3561c4a460c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though they stayed in the same house,⟪k:1⟫they both still lived solitary lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Anche se si trovavano nella stessa casa,⟪k:1⟫vivevano entrambi un’esistenza solitaria."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ac0c15e2c736c01b72a9c0967c7aad3dd402b7dad9e428d6dec4f328325b73d
#. default-sha256: 3faf93b86885163d9226e6b1c1def8290b1fa4b2126205ab49a736bd3243d054
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, the White-Haired Girl wanted to get to know Michel better."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nonostante ciò, la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi voleva conoscerlo meglio."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21e556ee9ed17fa59c9dbd0f916bb99c197c84bd85b3eccd4ebbcece07a9f47a
#. default-sha256: fb1419aa25ac80bc811e8df5d520410d1655a5d54b5df10a3fda88ab3d6de6ad
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She wanted to know why he called himself cursed,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Voleva sapere perché aveva affermato di essere maledetto,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34e8641c9c62b753a916e8f74fa8caa24dba95bc3ae410970617c1fe0322303b
#. default-sha256: 3ae7ae3424ad4e4d26b08540de1845e1f3ddbe8448f487d3faf9a03eec949219
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫why... ⟪k:1⟫he lived alone in this dark mansion,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫perché viveva da solo in quella villa solitaria,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a1c6da7c8af7661a6a7cb78e0c52b54b66e394fcd6627c59add47ecce3bed96
#. default-sha256: 99c7a5ac03ae4adf4f2815c2f155a9447ccab740b212cbc9027508c55e4f14c8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫how many days, how many years he had spent here in solitude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫per quanti giorni, per quanti anni aveva vissuto lì, isolato dal mondo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1b8c6423f5f6a808936c62bf66039fddc8ce2e845e4b7e2b2567a038a802f56
#. default-sha256: 56ffee72a623a3b921249b9a836a66875a329f44feaf6f104e8d441afb346b46
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while she waited for the opportunity, she also started doing things around the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E mentre aspettava l’opportunità giusta, cominciò a sbrigare alcune faccende in giro per la "
"casa."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d0b729392a67f08c0689a232bca1492793fd02bbe9670f5c3e2a0ba785a142e
#. default-sha256: 80a3766bfb513e3db95e584d771e393a92a892e18dbaf266dda3368d49dc331e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The first project she set out to take care of was cleaning. ⟪k:2⟫As the windows were "
"all firmly shut, her only source of light was candles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La prima attività a cui si dedicò fu la pulizia della villa.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Con le finestre "
"del tutto sigillate, la sua unica fonte di luce erano le candele."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f9d4a747bd43413ebf3c2adbb16a5a6faa426f7cd17da11f9cd62d591650ee5
#. default-sha256: 3f6026322e16e940684255a32ef5496516b187250578d07773a67e884520d3ec
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For whatever reason, there was a great deal of candles stored in the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Per qualche ragione, la cantina ne era piena."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 939aa4da2aed544e9ec4ee87d0c8d0dbb9174eb27e1b247d993e18dd4ed3a122
#. default-sha256: 2360b87039523433c088efa1a80ddc29c35aa881e91628e1d3cc40976388a118
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wondered where on earth he had acquired so many, but she never found the opportunity to "
"ask him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si domandava dove ne avesse comprate così tante, ma non aveva mai trovato l’occasione per "
"chiederglielo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23f029067d650ec1fb0f98819e37aff94577be47f50862df00d64a95b1392549
#. default-sha256: e74858e0d368669968df2c7318e9486f3c3af2f24faf59057f79769b33e446ce
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was difficult to even see all the dust and cobwebs with only candlelight, and considering "
"the poor airflow through the house, she was afraid her efforts were going to be in vain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era difficile persino ⟪k:1⟫vedere⟪k:2⟫ tutta la polvere e le ragnatele con la sola luce "
"delle candele, e considerando lo scarso flusso d’aria che attraversava la casa, temeva che i suoi "
"sforzi sarebbero stati vani."

#: scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a45a6b3eac40ac0493f702e69e27e983159712d47d6ec151b3adbf95d6d66e86
#. default-sha256: 3a55a27cc62dd5e51b7a6145aaed021e3ec3188ec74a7572edf1570b870b7d52
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Still she persisted, sweeping and wiping things down, one room at a time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eppure lei insistette, spazzando e strofinando ovunque, una stanza alla volta."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A9B09618_AA36_4C3F_8C7A_ECABE6D861FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19bccfb896e340f5fd6a47c68ee8a066e0b163867d7da4dc72a50419647da59d
#. default-sha256: f6082ed301e2b6c16d27cb5aa46095219bb142ae2c9a99ac4b8d513f43a8dbe0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A9B09618_AA36_4C3F_8C7A_ECABE6D861FF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, she made her way to the library.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The dust that had settled there was "
"much heavier than in any other room; ⟪k:3⟫with each breath, she had to fight back coughs."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Infine, si diresse alla biblioteca.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La polvere che si era depositata lì era molto "
"più densa che in qualsiasi altra stanza; ⟪k:3⟫ad ogni respiro, doveva lottare contro la tosse."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1ED3589A_04FC_4AA7_9181_C7023BD6EA65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a20f73aaad52d76d098784aac4566c40272bdf6b1bc821c44f1586188f4acdd
#. default-sha256: 1c3b2c7b16aa0828cd2f067dd863a8fb53d202cc70d6999433c8d952fd437818
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1ED3589A_04FC_4AA7_9181_C7023BD6EA65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was not a room one would normally be comfortable spending much time in, but the sight of "
"so many bulky volumes lining the shelves sent her heart aflutter with delight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Di norma, non era una stanza tanto confortante da volerci trascorrere gran parte del tempo, "
"ma la vista di tutti quei grossi volumi allineati sugli scaffali le faceva battere il cuore di "
"gioia."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AD3E8AC4_00BA_4D0A_A64F_22B99EEF6A3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60bba60e55210f75fec5af2f0bc1553e2d12443b56fba14a521864c509f2bc5f
#. default-sha256: 74ae0cfbee5e2da3d972241aa78da70eb975a60893bf1e8a072c81fa63c34fec
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AD3E8AC4_00BA_4D0A_A64F_22B99EEF6A3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They’re... ⟪k:1⟫books.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Incredible... ⟪k:4⟫Real books."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sono... ⟪k:1⟫libri.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Incredibile... ⟪k:4⟫Libri veri."

#: scenario4:scenario4_38886115_8108_4B46_86B1_0AA90E57CCA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 184924eb677303dd312ba7aa0e8477f81c59f340c2bcfc6dc81efc3ba9636271
#. default-sha256: e05ebe656c6a0a11c33ac6eea5e625ce7441aa1d990587360f6a800cedaf2522
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_38886115_8108_4B46_86B1_0AA90E57CCA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had never seen a book before. ⟪k:1⟫She had heard people describe them, "
"but that was the first time she had ever seen one for herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi non aveva mai visto un libro fino a quel momento. ⟪k:1⟫Ne "
"aveva sentito parlare, ma quella era la prima volta che ne vedeva uno dal vivo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5A11CAAD_2C90_4244_B40B_7A4D8700C78D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fb4a079d0ee9e83fde65d90c6b6ed2afc3c20baf7aaf7c038d6654f9427ecf5
#. default-sha256: 68d502baf3ebf490ee756ca9c9b4fa22cd1a9ba55cf215707077c3a93da0be3d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5A11CAAD_2C90_4244_B40B_7A4D8700C78D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Parchment was a very valuable commodity in that era."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La pergamena era un lusso costoso a quel tempo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_747EC42F_41F5_48AA_8961_BE4879CF3798
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47d479666a5fe8900966aee21faef02215ea10a757efb742ba0a5fb41989744f
#. default-sha256: 994b5990f6ad737e7e6ac3d42379aa95539a061743aa0acecb702ca5e7e12fcb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_747EC42F_41F5_48AA_8961_BE4879CF3798"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was something monks or scholarly priests made use of, and not a material one could easily "
"acquire without some degree of social rank."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era qualcosa di cui facevano uso i monaci o i preti istruiti,⟪k:1⟫e non era un materiale che "
"si poteva ottenere senza appartenere⟪k:2⟫ad un certo ceto sociale."

#: scenario4:scenario4_459918B0_5D9B_44F0_BDDC_30A3C489745D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a8057fc795b8c748f31cd69235c31b5e60f63add78b2027fd1406c474bae941
#. default-sha256: 45492b252fc603918f0442056f10979f4344e236e6dd1db05f1798e662505a6b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_459918B0_5D9B_44F0_BDDC_30A3C489745D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Books were not printed with machines, but copied by hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫I libri non venivano stampati con le macchine, ma copiati a mano."

#: scenario4:scenario4_75D69473_E7A3_4283_822D_A10B509FD98E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e2e3ee6f6c07c6e673cbe0a5880a95708973586df1c3eb3df3c590fadb4f585
#. default-sha256: c1bfbd36f00a99aa57c6b079e215b4da777f6cc83e5cefaaeeb70fb574547ee8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_75D69473_E7A3_4283_822D_A10B509FD98E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A single volume took an incredible amount of work to create.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Even the process of "
"binding was an art."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ogni singolo tomo richiedeva un’incredibile quantità di lavoro per essere realizzato.⟪k:1⟫ "
"Anche il processo di rilegatura era di per sé un’arte."

