msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though she tended to act older than her age, the White-Haired Girl was still in her early "
"teens and not especially tall. ⟪k:1⟫Even standing tiptoe, it was still just barely within reach."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Benché tendesse a comportarsi come un’adulta, la Ragazza dai⟪k:1⟫Capelli Bianchi era ancora "
"nella sua prima adolescenza, e non era particolarmente alta. ⟪k:2⟫Anche in punta di piedi, "
"quell’oggetto era per lei fuori portata."

