"⟪k:0⟫Looking around, she saw one volume that was almost torn in half.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not know "
"whether it was in that condition before,⟪k:3⟫or if it had happened in the fall,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Guardandosi intorno, vide un volume che era quasi strappato in due.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non sapeva se "
"era già in quelle condizioni, o se si era danneggiato nella caduta,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FB10DB0B_5422_436D_83ED_9AD64F4F92FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1965a836d0ff8919550d4f914828e593ba805aa6ae041f688cf93aab0609da51
