msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but nonetheless, she felt horribly guilty.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sitting there, unable to get back to her "
"feet,⟪k:3⟫tears began welling in her eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ma in ogni caso, si sentì terribilmente in colpa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mentre era seduta lì, incapace di "
"rimettersi in piedi,⟪k:3⟫le lacrime cominciarono a scendere dai suoi occhi."

